+
+// Paged-attention prefill, head size 128, integrated Xe3: the PVC-derived xehpc_h128 tile (128 queries x 256 keys per
+// 32-subgroup work group) leaves a 4-Xe-core part with ~128 coarse work groups. A 32-query x 128-key tile on 8
+// subgroups gives the scheduler 4x more, smaller work groups and measured -4 to -5 ms of Qwen3-0.6B prefill.
+// The 128-key tile changes the online-softmax accumulation order versus the 256-key tile, so results agree to rounding
+// but are not bit-identical. {16, 64, 32, 16, 16, 1, 4, 4} keeps the 256-key tile (bit-exact) for about 60% of the gain.
+sdpa_config_t xe3_h128_pa_prefill_integrated = {16, 32, 32, 16, 8, 1, 4, 2};
+
